      "filename": "Laboratorium Ingenieurakademie Wismar, Baumweg 3.jpg",
      "title": "File:Laboratorium Ingenieurakademie Wismar, Baumweg 3.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f1/Laboratorium_Ingenieurakademie_Wismar%2C_Baumweg_3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
